          ],
          "content": "Symmetry"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.12,
            0.834,
            0.166
          ],
          "content": "Fold it into half (for the fourth time), but this time along the other diagonal, as shown in the figure. Open out the fold."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.174,
            0.834,
            0.219
          ],
          "content": "Is there any other way to fold the square so that the two halves overlap? How many lines of symmetry does the square shape have?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.227,
            0.834,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": "Thus, figures can have multiple lines of symmetry. The figures below also have multiple lines of symmetry. Can you find them all?"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.136,
            0.283,
            0.354,
            0.434
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
